Package: tab10
Type: Package
Title: Apps for project Kansrijke Start
Version: 0.8.1
Description: The app that implements models to predict future childhood 
    overweight and language deficit at the age of four years. 
    The overweight model is designed to be applied at the age of four months. 
    The language deficit model is designed to be applied at the age of 24 months.
